kgf 0.6
language: ebnf
sources: .ebnf

=== lex
SKIP /[ \t]+/
TOKEN NL /\r?\n+/

TOKEN Comment /#[^\r\n]*/
TOKEN RuleNumber /\[[0-9]+\]/
TOKEN Define /::=/
TOKEN Literal /'([^'\\\r\n]|\\.)*'|"([^"\\\r\n]|\\.)*"/
TOKEN RegexClass /\[[^\]\r\n]+\]/
TOKEN Ident /[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_-]*/
TOKEN LPAREN /\(/
TOKEN RPAREN /\)/
TOKEN PIPE /\|/
TOKEN STAR /\*/
TOKEN PLUS /\+/
TOKEN QMARK /\?/
TOKEN DOT /\./
TOKEN COMMA /,/
TOKEN COLON /:/
TOKEN SLASH /\//
TOKEN LT /</
TOKEN GT />/
TOKEN EQ /=/
TOKEN MINUS /-/
TOKEN Other /[^\s]/

=== grammar
File -> Token*

Token -> NL / Comment / RuleNumber / Define / Literal / RegexClass / Ident
       / LPAREN / RPAREN / PIPE / STAR / PLUS / QMARK / DOT / COMMA
       / COLON / SLASH / LT / GT / EQ / MINUS / Other

=== features
content_type: document
identifier_kinds: Ident
coverage_token_kinds: Ident, Literal
vocabulary_token_kinds: Comment, Literal
insignificant_token_kinds: Comment
